  message: "You're right — `--note` does exist on `update` (it's shorthand for `discuss`). The original AGENTS.md text incorrectly claimed it didn't. Fixed in follow-up commit: updated to show both approaches (separate discuss command and combined --note flag). PR #1477 merged the initial guidance; the correction is in a follow-up PR."  # e31b
